--- !u!114 &934101315
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 934101314}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8b9da2a7c6e2e40a9b6382b429bd7d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  beats:
  - title: Why was I left behind?
    text: Opportunity was a robotic geologist. NASA sent it to study Martian rocks
      and soil for evidence of past water. Its mission was surface exploration, which
      it carried out on Mars.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d32b5c2b397abe4693d34dee71c55e3, type: 3}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Why did my mission end?
    text: 'In June 2018, a dust storm covered the whole planet and blocked the sunlight
      my solar panels needed. On June 10, 2018, I went quiet.


      Try to wake
      me up, the way my team did.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed211342019cc0547a15b8080d45d71b, type: 3}
    waitForEvent: 1
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 608871225}
  - title: My team never gave up
    text: Over eight months they sent more than a thousand commands. The last ones
      went out on February 12, 2019. The next day, NASA declared my mission complete.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c7f8346cc3120f4f8052ba7c6927687, type: 3}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Why remember me?
    text: 'I was built for a 90-sol mission. I lasted almost 15 years and drove 45.16
      kilometers. At Meridiani Planum, I found evidence that liquid water had altered
      rocks long ago.


      On October 11, 2026, NASA''s Perseverance rover surpassed
      my driving-distance record.'
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d098a5cfd24fcd6479532d8679c33854, type: 3}
    waitForEvent: 0
    showWhileActive: {fileID: 0}
  nextLabel: Next
  finishLabel: Return to Earth
  hideButtonOnLastBeat: 0
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 2052486109}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: NasaHack.LoadNextScene, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: Load
        m_Mode: 1
